    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d183">

                <pb facs="0185" n="173" xml:id="pg173"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">701.4161/43: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Steinhardt</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1941-06-14T13:00:00+03:00">June 14, 1941—1
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received June 14—12:15 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1145. I learn that the British Embassy yesterday received instructions from
                    London to evacuate all women and children in the Embassy from the Soviet
                    Union.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Steinhardt</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
